    "title": "PoE early league appreciating assets",
    "text": "Investments: (Investments spike day 3, day 7 and 2-3 weeks into league on average. Items spike earlier generally)\nHigh End Investments: Mirrors, Mirror Shards, Locks, Reflecting Mists, Awakeners orb, Veiled Exalts\nMedium End Investments: Maven Chisels, Tempering/Tailoring orbs, Eldritch Currency, Orb of dominance, Divine teardrop, Fracture orbs\nLow End Investments: Divine orbs primarily to protect against inflation. Alterations and regrets can be good if you buy early but are mild profit.\nItem Investments: Heist bases. Sublime visions, good watchers, ice bite shako, kalandras touch, etc . GG corrupts like power charge/rmr helmets. \nStream Sniping: Invest in what streamers are doing to resell. Stalk their characters on poe.ninja. If you invest when they make a youtube video it is too late. (Only for the true degenerates)\n\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1G7pQkSOIUgkZceOqj_xgj0VsApmpfaX4WDDe078vVqw/edit?pli=1&tab=t.0",
